ity: Vendor + L1 + Country -&gt; Category (copy)_3863736673606176807] THEN [vendor_availability]&#10;ELSEIF [Category View Granularity: Vendor + L1 + Category -&gt; Country (copy)_3863736673606672424] THEN [vendor_availability]&#10;ELSEIF [Category View Granularity: Vendor + L2 + Category -&gt; Country (copy)_3863736673606737961] THEN [vendor_availability]&#10;END' />
            </column>
